{"formal_ids": ["GS-719"], "labels": ["单连通区域", "多元函数积分学", "曲线积分", "第二型曲线积分", "路径无关"], "metadata": {"capture_ids": ["MFI-CAP-4cd4f907239aacf46fce0a29"], "closeout_id": "MFI-CLOSE-a771ee2111457ce9ae5143ee", "conversation_complete": true, "coverage": "full_bytes", "files": [{"path": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-27/MATHPKG-1dfce489a6eb058b44877411/conversation.json", "sha256": "6f9666bc651159d2b1c89e8eb7ffa5f716d02f0d874f912f2b711da0c87cc8fd", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-27/MATHPKG-1dfce489a6eb058b44877411/source.json", "sha256": "7993d4276d73631836df3cc83ac2ce688b3843e5f9077c1d3baa08242c86b0f1", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-27/MATHPKG-1dfce489a6eb058b44877411/attachments/question_image_01.png", "sha256": "1f929cddd92fe74018ce8dacafd1d0272b8c43d78ed13f146d983f554771b4c4", "status": "verified", "text_status": "text_unavailable_no_ocr"}], "original_path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-27/MATHPKG-1dfce489a6eb058b44877411", "original_sha256": "7b80ddf2d1c407e8764f5f906ddb417a3407b3326b7d2488aa42929715e381e9", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-d90e92ec30cb124718951cd5", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/d544965239ea24e76dca9508cacca27cd67b9b62a3b5e7c597d1d80f0b161bc7.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "d544965239ea24e76dca9508cacca27cd67b9b62a3b5e7c597d1d80f0b161bc7", "user_turn_count": 4, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 407], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "7c4ef74f04158ae86b5fba78fcc0ef83e321705efd72aca4ab8e049508400e56", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 124], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "a7bb182d8047da5a63f539a5dd8c1f59986372140e35bd374eb6cc96712ecea4", "role": "user", "sequence": 4}, {"character_range": [0, 110], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "8a63fbd4976ce82715150776cb71359709cfc6b3f3efb8ba604e4b9c84de9505", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}, {"character_range": [0, 14], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "5d65a363d25048250f1af8cb04513462642b7ee78667c28f8ef1c415e92fbb7a", "role": "user", "sequence": 10}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "[http://127.0.0.1:8765/open/GS-719](http://127.0.0.1:8765/open/GS-719) 这道题我完全无从下手，主要是不清楚在区域内“积分与路径无关”到底意味着什么。\n\n是不是指积分与路径无关就意味着可以用格林公式？还是用什么别的公式去做？比如通过 ∂Q/∂x - ∂P/∂y 转化成一个二重积分去做？\n\n这道题里：\n• P = x / (x² + y² - 1)\n• Q = -ay / (x² + y² - 1)\n\n我觉得直接分别求偏导太难算了，是这么算吗？还是有更简单的方法？\n\n我知道这种曲线积分跟二重积分不一样，如果已知 x² + y² - 1 等于某个常数，我会直接代入到积分里去做。但题目给的是 x² + y² < 1，也就是 x² + y² - 1 < 0。如果分母 x² + y² - 1 = 0 的话岂不是有奇点？\n\n所以这道题到底该怎么做？"}